    "description": "An expandable date picker with smooth in-place layout transitions.",
    "longDescription": "A beautiful date picker that starts as a pill-shaped input and seamlessly expands into a full calendar grid using React Native Reanimated. Features date range constraints, custom theming, and premium modern aesthetics.",
